WEBVTT

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:02.900
Are you a SMART fella,

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.933
or a FART smella?

00:00:04.933 --> 00:00:06.433
Let's find OUT!

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:09.333
Check this out,

00:00:09.333 --> 00:00:11.033
a word analogy!

00:00:11.033 --> 00:00:13.333
Cow is to moo,

00:00:13.333 --> 00:00:15.600
as dog is to...

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:16.200
what?

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:16.767
A.

00:00:16.767 --> 00:00:17.333
Meow,

00:00:17.333 --> 00:00:17.900
B.

00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:18.467
Bark,

00:00:18.467 --> 00:00:19.033
C.

00:00:19.033 --> 00:00:19.633
Bone,

00:00:19.633 --> 00:00:20.767
or D.

00:00:20.767 --> 00:00:21.333
Tail?

00:00:21.333 --> 00:00:22.467
Five seconds!

00:00:28.267 --> 00:00:29.467
TIME'S UP!

00:00:30.133 --> 00:00:30.633
It's...

00:00:30.633 --> 00:00:31.133
B,

00:00:31.133 --> 00:00:31.600
bark!

00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.567
A cow says moo,

00:00:33.567 --> 00:00:36.033
so a dog says bark.

00:00:36.033 --> 00:00:39.500
It is the sound each animal makes.

00:00:40.633 --> 00:00:41.233
Okay,

00:00:41.233 --> 00:00:43.000
a number series!

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:43.600
Eighty,

00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:44.167
forty,

00:00:44.167 --> 00:00:44.767
twenty,

00:00:44.767 --> 00:00:45.367
ten,

00:00:45.367 --> 00:00:46.533
and then...

00:00:46.533 --> 00:00:48.300
what comes next?

00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:48.900
A.

00:00:48.900 --> 00:00:49.500
Five,

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:50.067
B.

00:00:50.067 --> 00:00:50.667
Eight,

00:00:50.667 --> 00:00:51.267
C.

00:00:51.267 --> 00:00:51.833
Fifteen,

00:00:51.833 --> 00:00:53.033
or D.

00:00:53.033 --> 00:00:53.600
Six?

00:00:53.600 --> 00:00:54.800
Five seconds!

00:01:00.567 --> 00:01:01.767
TIME'S UP!

00:01:02.433 --> 00:01:03.967
The answer is...

00:01:03.967 --> 00:01:04.500
A,

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:05.000
five!

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:08.100
Each number is cut in half:

00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:08.600
eighty,

00:01:08.600 --> 00:01:09.133
forty,

00:01:09.133 --> 00:01:09.633
twenty,

00:01:09.633 --> 00:01:10.133
ten,

00:01:10.133 --> 00:01:13.233
so half of ten is five.

00:01:14.400 --> 00:01:15.500
Here's one,

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:17.167
a shape puzzle!

00:01:17.167 --> 00:01:19.367
Which shape comes next?

00:01:19.367 --> 00:01:19.933
A.

00:01:19.933 --> 00:01:21.033
A circle,

00:01:21.033 --> 00:01:21.600
B.

00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:22.700
A square,

00:01:22.700 --> 00:01:23.267
C.

00:01:23.267 --> 00:01:24.367
A triangle,

00:01:24.367 --> 00:01:25.467
or D.

00:01:25.467 --> 00:01:26.567
A pentagon?

00:01:26.567 --> 00:01:27.667
Five seconds!

00:01:33.467 --> 00:01:34.667
TIME'S UP!

00:01:35.333 --> 00:01:36.833
The answer is...

00:01:36.833 --> 00:01:37.333
B,

00:01:37.333 --> 00:01:38.333
a square!

00:01:38.333 --> 00:01:41.367
The sides count down by one:

00:01:41.367 --> 00:01:42.367
heptagon seven,

00:01:42.367 --> 00:01:43.367
hexagon six,

00:01:43.367 --> 00:01:44.367
pentagon five,

00:01:44.367 --> 00:01:47.367
so next is the square with

00:01:47.367 --> 00:01:48.367
four sides.

00:01:49.533 --> 00:01:49.933
So,

00:01:49.933 --> 00:01:51.967
are you smart or fart?

00:01:51.967 --> 00:01:54.400
Count up your correct answers to

00:01:54.400 --> 00:01:55.600
find your rank!

00:01:56.767 --> 00:01:57.100
So,

00:01:57.100 --> 00:01:58.500
how did you do?

00:01:58.500 --> 00:01:59.867
Comment your score below,

00:01:59.867 --> 00:02:01.233
and follow for more!
